{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"closer\":\"X\",\"x_off\":[\"S08：短暂落在熟悉的安静带来的喘息感上，与怀念旧日亲近关系和归属感的直接联系稍弱。\"],\"y_off\":[\"S09：把对旧日生活及归属的怀念改写成难受时想有人陪伴，缩窄了 Center 的怀念对象，也把具体的归属渴望转成了对陪伴的需求。\",\"S13：将对未来能否重新拥有自然亲近关系的牵挂，部分转成对未来孤单的担忧，弱化了旧日归属与维持尊严之间的拉扯。\"],\"why\":\"X 更直接地让不愿再受委屈、舍不得曾被当作自己人的日子、害怕失去归属这几样东西相互牵动，并在反复拉扯中走向不为陪伴而放弃尊严的选择。Y 整体也很接近，但几处把核心关系偏移成了对孤独和陪伴的担忧。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1711db90-88ec-4d77-a099-c625a7bdaed2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T085009852545Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T08:50:27.884251+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bbb19f3689d63e1bc736c3512eee350a115ae356308f5d26a0b1fb4bd4b1adc4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screen